<title>USA: Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle market inactive - USDA.</title>
<headline>Texas/w Okla feedlot cattle market inactive - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was inactive in the Panhandle area early Tuesday, USDA said. Slaughter steers and heifers not tested. Feedlots reporting light inquiry.</p>
<p>There were  20,200 head confirmed for the week to date which includes 16,700 formulated and 43 loads or 1,500 head of CME delivery cattle.</p>
<p>Confirmed - None</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720--</p>
</text>
